<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JD Group details capitalisation award.</title>
<headline>JD Group details capitalisation award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail distributor JD Group Ltd said on Monday it would offer capitalisation shares in the ratio of 1,3333 shares for every 100 shares held on March 14.</p>
<p>Shareholders may elect to receive an interim cash dividend of 30 cents per share for the six month period ended December 31 1996 instead, the group said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
